  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-08-15T00:26:41.461Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hiya, one of the biggest problems I see in a public lobby is when we have ourselves a troll that likes to drop portals in the middle of an Instance. Example would be in Prison Escape or other games that takes others to the lobby, someone drops a portal in front or in middle of the room and sometimes by accident those individuals get sent to another world. My suggestion/idea would be to allow the instance Leader, admin or moderator of the instances would be permitted to click on the portal to shut it down to protect the people within the instance.\n\nYes I am aware of the portal prompt and have mine activated when I click the trigger but there are those that are unaware of such features including new players to VRChat. I would love to hear some feedback on this idea and hope it comes to light in near future updates. Thank you for your time.",
